span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">to Whitefield Road and Krishnarajapuram Railway Station, </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">drawing</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">professionals</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">due</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">to</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> its </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">vicinity</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> to </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">prominent</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> IT </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">parks</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> in Whitefield and Marathahalli.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Located near some of the key neighborhoods like Hoodi, KR Puram, and Brookfield, Mahadevapura (pincode 560048) is a residential area with ease of access to schools, malls, and recreational areas. Having existing and planned real estate developments, it is a high growth area, thereby a good pick for home buyers and investors alike. If you are looking for residential area or an easily connected city life, Mahadevapura is a fast-growing area in East Bangalore.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3021460c-7fff-1743-ea63-177ee66b167d\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Connectivity- Distance, Metro, BTMC Buses</b></span></span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3021460c-7fff-1743-ea63-177ee66b167d\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br></b></span></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3021460c-7fff-1743-ea63-177ee66b167d\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Distance from key areas:</span></span></h3><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3021460c-7fff-1743-ea63-177ee66b167d\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><b>Destination</b></td><td><b>Distance</b></td><td><b>Travel Time(appx.)</b></td><td><b>Route</b></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Whitefield</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">11 Kms</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">30 mins</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">via HAL Old Airport Rd/Varthur Main Rd</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Marathahalli</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">5.4 Kms</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">20 mins</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">via Service Rd and NH 44</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">KR puram railway station</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">4.6 Kms</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">20 mins</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">via NH 44</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">MG Road</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">10.3 Kms</span></td><td>40 mins</td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">via Swami Vivekananda Rd</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kempegowda International Airport</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">39.6 Kms</span></td><td>1 hour</td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">via NH 44</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Metro Connectivity in Mahadevapura</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Mahadevapura enjoys smooth metro connectivity through Namma Metro's Purple Line at Singayyanapalya station (previously called as Mahadevapura station). This elevated station is located on the East-West corridor, and it is convenient to reach key places in Bengaluru.</span></p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Key Purple Line Routes:</span></h4><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Purple Line connects Mahadevapura to key places, including:</span></p><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Whitefield (Kadugodi)</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">Krishnarajapura (KR Puram)</li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">MG Road (Central Business District)</li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">Kengeri (West Bengaluru)</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Frequent metro connectivity takes people to a fast, hassle-free ride through IT parks, commercial complexes, and entertainment belts in the city. Such access continues to turn Mahadevapura into the most connected population residential as well as working site.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">BMTC Bus Connectivity in Mahadevapura</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Mahadevapura is also easily accessible by BMTC buses, offering connectivity to other cities of Bengaluru. Some of the prominent routes that operate within the area are:</span></p><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">304 Series (304, 304B, 304D, 304E, 304H, 304J, 304M)</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">Other prominent routes</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">These offer connectivity between Mahadevapura and prominent transfer points such as:</span></p><ul><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Kempegowda Bus Station (Majestic)</span></li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">Krishnarajendra Market (KR Market)</li><li style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\">Shivajinagar Bus Station</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 10pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Through regular trips and more routes, BMTC buses provide an affordable and convenient means of going around the city, making Mahadevapura accessible for everyday commuters.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p