al; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Final Thoughts</b></span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4ab3d5c8-7fff-1ae8-922c-42f5cfb40f45\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Mahadevapura blends city convenience and living comfort in perfect harmony to emerge as one of the finest localities in East Bangalore. With excellent connectivity via metro and main roads, close proximity to finest IT parks, and a well-established social infrastructure of schools, hospitals, and lifestyle amenities, it has all that a modern resident or investor would need. Although there are some issues such as traffic and water in some locations, developmental efforts are always trying to sort them out.</span></p>",
